{"4256570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forecast Death", "steam_appid": 4256570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE FOR SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forecast Death is a fast-paced survival roguelike action game. Your task is to hold back the onslaught of endless enemy armies on a randomly generated map. Collect experience, develop your hero's talents, and find rare artifacts to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.poster.avif?t=1786906425\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.webm?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.mp4?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NATURE AGAINST YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main danger lies not only in monsters. A unique cataclysm system forces you to adapt on the fly. Powerful thunderstorms, thick fog, and sudden earthquakes change the landscape and game conditions in the heat of battle. Learn to use the power of the elements to your advantage or become their next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/2ee82508aa568a1c12c24a51528610ea.poster.avif?t=1786906425\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/2ee82508aa568a1c12c24a51528610ea.webm?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/2ee82508aa568a1c12c24a51528610ea.mp4?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR PATH TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is unique thanks to different combinations of abilities. Experiment to turn your hero into an unstoppable force. Find your playstyle: from lightning-fast melee attacks to devastating spells that clear the entire screen of enemies in seconds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Heroes</strong> with unique starting skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ different upgrades</strong> to create unique builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7+ types of cataclysms</strong> that change the rules of survival</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE FOR SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forecast Death is a fast-paced survival roguelike action game. Your task is to hold back the onslaught of endless enemy armies on a randomly generated map. Collect experience, develop your hero's talents, and find rare artifacts to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.poster.avif?t=1786906425\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.webm?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256570/extras/8cdf81570d449503b900e84b57b48a70.mp4?t=1786906425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_t